  "notes": "Identify the exact inspection, including its re-inspection, by inspectionSystemId. testCode is the test code, not its caption. value is text (maximum 250 characters); an empty string clears it if Microsoft permits. Unknown keys, missing keys, non-text values and overlong values are refused. The inspection must be open and have exactly one matching test line. Microsoft validation and result rules apply. The standard path has no explicit Commit; explicit commits from subscribers are prohibited. Normal execution uses a separate transaction, so a business refusal rolls back all writes. With Omit Commit, the caller owns rollback. Repeating the same value is not guaranteed idempotent because Microsoft validation can update related expressions and invoke subscribers. No external provider is called."
